      "description": "How long has it been since you wrote your own lines? ✍️✨\n\n\"Letters to Self\" are not only stickers, but also an inspiration – an invitation by vision, a gentle message that: you deserve to chat with your mind. My soul. 💌\n\nStamps, delicately illustrated by artist Cu, is the \"betel nut that opens the story\", starting your own letters – sending it to yourself. 📮\n\nEach stamp is pre-packaged, just peel it off and stick it on ✨ There is also a beautiful small serrated line, so that you can easily separate each stamp - keep it for yourself, or send it to your loved ones. 💕\n\nIf you want to feel more luxurious, try the 3D silver emulsion version that teayou has been special for this product, it will definitely not let everyone down..\n\nProduct parameters:\n\nDimensions: Cycle 4 cm x 109 cm (total 20 different stamps), full roll 10m.\nMaterial: Matte PET | Glossy printing | With Embossed Silver Emulsion (if selected)\nMachining: pre-rimmed, serrated cutting\nIllustrated by Chon \nOriginal product by teayoushop",
